  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ni maneno ga chilagane ambacho Mwenyezi Mlungu waamuru Musa ahende na Aiziraeli kpwenye tsi ya Moabu, mbali na chira ambacho Mwenyezi Mlungu wahenda nao hiko mwango Horebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achiiha Aiziraeli osi phamwenga achiaambira, “Mwaona enye vira Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyomuhenda mfalume wa Misiri, atue osi na tsiiye yosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaona enye na matso genu majaribu makulu, ishara na vilinje arivyohenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hadi rero Mwenyezi Mlungu kadzangbwekuphani achili ya kuelewa, matso ga kuona, wala masikiro ga kusikira!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mimi nákulongozani jangbwani, kpwa muda wa miaka mirongo mine na nguwo zenu mrizovwala taziyatsakala wala virahu vyenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamyarya mkpwahe, tamyanwa uchi wa zabibu wala uchi wowosi mufu, ili mmanye kukala Mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
