          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 21:21–30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 21:31–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na mriphofika hipha, mfalume Sihoni wa Heshiboni na mfalume Ogi wa Bashani akpwedzapigana naswi, ela huchiaturya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 32:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "huchihala tsi zao, huchiganyira mbari za Rubini, Gadi na nusu mbari ya Manase ikale mali yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo hakikishani munagbwira maneno gosi ga chilagane hichi kusudi mphahe kuongokerwa kahi ya kazi zenu zosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwimwi mosi rero, mkaima mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu; vilongozi enu a mbari, atumia enu na akulu enu mwi Aiziraeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ana enu, achetu enu na ajeni anaosagala kahi yenu anaokutsangirani kuni na kukuhekerani madzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rero mu hipha ili kuhenda chilagane na Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na kuhakikisha kpwa kuapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo rero Mwenyezi Mlungu andakuhakikishirani kukala mu atue naye andakala Mlungu wenu, dza vira arivyokuapirani mwimwi na akare enu yani Burahimu, Isaka na Jakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihenda chilagane hichi rero kpwa ajili yenu bahi na kuhadza lanaze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela ni kpwa ajili yehu swiswi huimireo mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu na piya hinyo ambao taaphamwenga naswi rero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mnamanya vira hurivyosagala tsi ya Misiri na vira hurivyosafiri tsi za mataifa ganjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaona vizuka vyao vya kutsukiza, milungu ya mihi na mawe, ya feza na zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 12:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakikishani kukala taphana mlume, mchetu, mryango au mbari yoyosi yiimireyo hipha rero ndiyomricha Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu, ili kuhumikira milungu ya mataifa ganjina. Dzambo hiri rindakala kama muzi ndiotsephula na kuvyala matunda ga utsungu genye sumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichikala bada ya kusikira maneno ga chilagane hichi ambacho mkaapishwa, mutu andadziamini mwakpwe moyoni na aambe kukala andakala salama hata achilunga uyi wa moyowe, likakado hiro rindasababisha kuangamizwa kpwa atu osi, anono na ayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu kandaswamehe mutu hiye, na tsukizize na wivuwe vindamuakira mutu hiye. Lana zosi zoandikpwa kpwenye chitabu hichi zindamphaha, naye Mwenyezi Mlungu andafuta tsetsetse dzina ra mutu hiye duniani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu andamtenga kula kahi ya mbari zosi za Iziraeli aphahwe ni mapigo kulengana na lana zosi za chilagane zoandikpwa kpwenye chitabu chichi cha shariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati wa chivyazi chedzacho, ana enu na ajeni kula tsi za kure achiona mapigo na makongo ambago Mwenyezi Mlungu akagareha kpwenye tsi hino, andaamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 19:24–25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tsi yosi ikakala litsapi ikabwiningizwa ni mawe ga moho wa chibiriti na munyu; takuna ndichophandwa hata nyasi tazindamera kuko. Tsi ikakala dza midzi ya Sodoma na Gomora, Adima na Seboimu ambazo Mwenyezi Mlungu waziangamiza wakati kala akatsukirwa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho atu a mataifa ganjina gosi andauza aambe, ‘Kpwa utu wani Mwenyezi Mlungu akaihenda vino tsi hino? Kpwa utu wani watsukirwa sana?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao andajibiwa hiri, ‘Ni kpwa sababu avundza chilagane cha Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa akare aho arichoika nao ariphoatuluza kula tsi ya Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achendahumikira na kuabudu milungu yanjina asiyoimanya na ambayo akahazwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyo mana Mwenyezi Mlungu watsukirirwa sana tsi hino na kuirehera lana zosi zoandikpwa kpwenye chitabu chichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mwenyezi Mlungu, achiausa kula kpwenye tsi yao kpwa usiru na tsukizi nyinji, achiatsupha kpwenye tsi yanjina dza arivyo rero.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
