          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mambo ga siri ni ga Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu, ela gara ambago gakaikpwa wazi ni gehu na ana ehu hata kare na kare, ili hugbwire maneno gosi ga shariya hino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
